~~~/README.md
# Strategic Analytics Dashboard

A highly detailed, gamified, interactive analytics dashboard with micro-animations and immersive storytelling theme. Built for enterprise analytics visualization with a Novartis/IDSync inspired design system.

## Features

- **3-Column Layout**: Strategic imperatives sidebar, main content area, and quick actions panel
- **Interactive Charts**: Line charts with animated progress tracking and hover effects
- **Expandable Cards**: Click-to-expand functionality with progressive content disclosure
- **Micro-animations**: 200ms ease-in-out transitions on all interactive elements
- **Dark Theme**: Immersive dark theme with gradient backgrounds and glow effects

## Dependencies

```json
{
  "react": "^18.2.0",
  "react-dom": "^18.2.0",
  "framer-motion": "^11.0.0",
  "lucide-react": "^0.400.0",
  "recharts": "^2.12.0"
}
```

## Component Props & Types

### StrategicAnalyticsDashboard

The main dashboard component. No props required.

```tsx
import { StrategicAnalyticsDashboard } from '@/sd-components/[component-id]';

function App() {
  return <StrategicAnalyticsDashboard />;
}
```

### Types

```typescript
type ProjectStatus = 'Completed' | 'In Progress' | 'Blocked';

interface Project {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  subtitle: string;
  date: string;
  status: ProjectStatus;
}

interface Pillar {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  percentage: number;
  color: string;
}

interface MetricCard {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  value: string;
  change: number;
  description: string;
  icon: 'projects' | 'requests' | 'progress' | 'pending';
}

interface KeyInsight {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  tag: string;
}
```

## Usage Example

```tsx
import { StrategicAnalyticsDashboard } from '@/sd-components/[component-id]';

export default function App() {
  return <StrategicAnalyticsDashboard />;
}
```

## Component Structure

- `/src/Component.tsx` - Main dashboard component
- `/src/components/Header.tsx` - Top navigation with logo and profile
- `/src/components/Navigation.tsx` - Tab navigation
- `/src/components/StrategicImperatives.tsx` - Left sidebar with project cards
- `/src/components/ProjectHealthHeader.tsx` - Header with filters and view toggle
- `/src/components/PillarCard.tsx` - Individual pillar progress cards
- `/src/components/HealthChart.tsx` - Interactive line chart
- `/src/components/MetricCard.tsx` - Expandable metric cards
- `/src/components/QuickActions.tsx` - Quick action buttons
- `/src/components/KeyInsights.tsx` - Insight cards
- `/src/types/index.ts` - TypeScript type definitions
- `/src/data/mockData.ts` - Sample data
- `/src/hooks/` - Custom React hooks
